CM_ SG_ 1143 LIMITER_METHOD_BYTE "Bit-field containing:
- Bits 7-4: ENGINE_LIMITER_METHOD (0=No Cut, 1=Fuel, 2=Ignition, 3=Fuel and Ignition)
- Bits 3-0: RPM_LIMITER_METHOD (0=No Cut, 1=Fuel, 2=Ignition, 3=Fuel and Ignition)

Use the following to extract values:
- ENGINE_LIMITER_METHOD = (LIMITER_METHOD_BYTE >> 4) & 0x0F
- RPM_LIMITER_METHOD = LIMITER_METHOD_BYTE & 0x0F";
